url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Each new line is a whole new paragraph for the class reference.\r\n```suggestion\r\n\t\t\tThe list of colors to use to color each pair of brackets. The color for a bracket pair is determined by its nesting level. The first color in the array is used for the outermost level, the second for the first nested level, and so on. If the nesting level exceeds the number of colors in the array, the colors will repeat from the beginning. An empty array disables this feature.\r\n```","created_at":"2025-11-08T19:32:39Z","updated_at":"2025-11-08T19:55:36Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112314#discussion_r2507087046","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112314","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2507087046"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112314#discussion_r2507087046"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112314"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2507087046/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":1600,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":null,"original_line":1602,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":7,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2507087311","pull_request_review_id":3438546657,"id":2507087311,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6Vbx3P","diff_hunk":"@@ -76,6 +76,10 @@ Dictionary GDScriptSyntaxHighlighter::_get_line_syntax_highlighting_impl(int p_l\n \tint in_declaration_param_dicts = 0; // The number of ope